      "rationale": "Submit a single zip named 48008361.zip containing matrixMultiply.cpp, matrixMultiplyGPU.cu, matrixMultiplyMPI.cpp, and slurm.zip (an archive of all slurm job output files, slurm-xxxx.out). Unimplemented parts must be submitted as the original blank default .cpp files. The format is strict: any deviation is rejected by the automated scripts associated with Assignment1_GradeBot.",
